      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ANGRY ADVENTURE (1) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at Nowra over 365m behind Rocking Highway (21.31) in a Grade 5. Has ability and is a key runner. FANCY PAY CHEQUE (8) took advantage of the inside draw with an all-the-way win last start (22.35) at Gosford in a Grade 5 over 388m. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Leading chance again. SHIRLEY'S ETHICS (4) missed the frame latest when sixth at this track (31.13) but was a winner four back in the best time of the program. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Better than last start and can bounce back. EXQUISITE ETHICS (2) has been in the money at her last two runs, most recently when third (30.44) in a Grade 5 over 520m at this track.",
